# 2. About Mul Smart Platform

## What is Mul Smart?

Mul Smart is the integrated technology platform of Mul Biotech Farms designed to simplify biological production systems using scientific protocols, digital tools, and intelligent monitoring.

Instead of selling only equipment or consultancy, Mul Smart delivers complete implementation-ready solutions where biology remains the foundation and technology enhances efficiency, monitoring, and decision-making.

The platform is modular, allowing different biological systems to share the same digital infrastructure while maintaining standardized operating procedures.

---

